        <briefdescription>
<para>Digital pin button with debouncing and level normalization. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Combines:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="classeva_1_1_digital_pin_reader" kindref="compound">DigitalPinReader</ref> for raw pin reading</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classeva_1_1_stabilize_decor" kindref="compound">StabilizeDecor</ref> for debouncing (120ms stability)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classeva_1_1_binarize_eq_decor" kindref="compound">BinarizeEqDecor</ref> for mapping to active/inactive based on specified level</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Long click threshold is fixed at 750ms.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>PIN</parametername>
