<para>Pin mode (INPUT, INPUT_PULLUP, etc.) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>ACTIVATES_ON</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Level that means &quot;pressed&quot; (LOW or HIGH) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
