<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/>GND<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>-----+------+------+--<sp/>...<sp/>----+</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Each switch produces a different ADC value when activated. The <ref refid="classeva_1_1_quantize_decor" kindref="compound">QuantizeDecor</ref> maps these values to discrete level codes (1, 2, 3...). <ref refid="classeva_1_1_stabilize_decor" kindref="compound">StabilizeDecor</ref> provides debouncing.</para>
